DATA NOTICE: mt

Data files (not stored by HeCBench):
  MersenneTwister.dat, MersenneTwister.raw (downloaded by fetch.sh)

What:
  MersenneTwister.dat: precomputed Mersenne Twister parameter sets.
  MersenneTwister.raw: reference output used for verification.

Source:
  NVIDIA GPU Computing SDK, oclMersenneTwister sample:
    https://developer.download.nvidia.com/compute/DevZone/OpenCL/Projects/oclMersenneTwister.zip
  ("NVIDIA GPU Computing SDK/OpenCL/src/oclMersenneTwister/data/").
  fetch.sh downloads the zip, checks its MD5
  (74ee39ff40b3ddc2fff22f8d5d27fbb8) and extracts the two files; CMake
  runs it at configure time and the Makefiles before `make run`. The
  parameter sets are made with Matsumoto & Nishimura's Dynamic Creator
  (DCMT).

Copyright:
  NVIDIA Corporation.

License:
  NVIDIA's license (license.txt in the zip) grants use of the sample
  and allows distributing modified source code, but not redistributing
  NVIDIA's files. HeCBench therefore does not store these files; each
  user downloads them from NVIDIA and agrees to NVIDIA's license.

Used by:
  mt-cuda, mt-hip, mt-omp, mt-sycl

This data keeps its upstream terms. HeCBench's top-level BSD-3-Clause
LICENSE does not apply to it.
